    <!--
    Thrust Coefficient Table: C_T vs Advance Ratio (J)

    Advance Ratio: J = V / (n * D)
    where:
      V = velocity (ft/s)
      n = RPM / 60 (revolutions per second)
      D = diameter (ft)

    For pitch ratio 0.36 (5.4/15):
    - High static thrust (J=0)
    - C_T zero crossing around J~0.75
    - Moderate thrust dropoff with forward speed

    Thrust calculation: T = C_T * ρ * n² * D⁴
    where ρ = air density (slugs/ft³)

    C_T(J=0) derived from motor test data:
      T = 2228 g = 4.912 lbf @ 6177 RPM (100% throttle, 24V)
      C_T = T / (ρ * n² * D⁴) ≈ 0.07877
